<p id="alg1.15" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel"><math id="alg1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R^{2}=calculerR^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">R</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">R</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{2}=calculerR^{2}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> <span id="alg1.15.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(modèle, IP, resource)</span> </span></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><span id="alg1.16" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\Si</span><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="alg1.17" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel"><math id="alg1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.9\leq R^{2}&lt;meilleur\_R^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">0.9</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">R</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">&lt;</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">R</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.9\leq R^{2}&lt;meilleur\_R^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="alg1.18" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel"><math id="alg1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="meilleur\_R^{2}=R^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">R</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">R</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">meilleur\_R^{2}=R^{2}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.18.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="alg1.19" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel"><span id="alg1.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">meilleur_modèle = modèle<span id="alg1.19.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> 

</span></span>
<span id="alg1.19.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="alg1.19.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">s_modèle = SupprimerInsignifiant (meilleur_modèle)</span> </span></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="alg1.20" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel"><math id="alg1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\_R^{2}=calculerR^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">R</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">R</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\_R^{2}=calculerR^{2}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">(s_modèle, IP, ressource)<span id="alg1.20.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> </span></span></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><span id="alg1.21" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\Si</span><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="alg1.22" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel"><math id="alg1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\_R^{2}\geq 0.9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">R</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">≥</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\_R^{2}\geq 0.9</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.22.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="alg1.22.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">meilleur_modèle = s_modèle</span> 

</span></p></div></div>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S4" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">4 </span>Validation</h2>

<section id="S4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.1 </span>Mesures de performance</h3>

<div id="S4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Pour évaluer la précision et la fiabilité des modèles, quatre mesures de performance sont utilisées : l’erreur quadratique moyenne (EQM), l’erreur absolue moyenne (EAM), le coefficient de détermination (<math id="S4.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>) et l’erreur absolue moyenne en pourcentage (EAMP). Ces mesures sont essentielles pour garantir que les estimations de la consommation des ressources FPGA correspondent aux résultats réels. Les résultats, présentés dans la Table <a href="#S4.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ 4.1 Mesures de performance ‣ 4 Validation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, confirment que les modèles mathématiques prédisent avec précision la consommation de LLUTs avec des valeurs <math id="S4.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> élevées et de faibles erreurs.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Mesures d’erreur pour LLUT Models.</figcaption>
<table id="S4.T4.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T4.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T4.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_r"><span id="S4.T4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\toprule</span><span id="S4.T4.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bloc</span></th>
<th id="S4.T4.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column"><span id="S4.T4.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">EQM</span></th>
<th id="S4.T4.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column"><span id="S4.T4.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">EAM</span></th>
<th id="S4.T4.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column"><math id="S4.T4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{R^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝐑</mi><mn>𝟐</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{R^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<th id="S4.T4.2.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column"><span id="S4.T4.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">EAMP (%)</span></th></tr>
</thead>
